- Professional NASA-style technical report aesthetic.
- Dark navy or black cover page.
- Clean white or light report pages for readability.
- Consistent typography.
- Proper scientific notation and units.
- Page numbers.
- Report generation timestamp.
- Clear tables with repeating headers.
- Footer containing the Lunar Browser project identity.

The PDF must support all selected locations and must not truncate comparison columns or values.

Use the same scientific calculation results displayed in the application. The PDF must never independently generate different values.

Add a clear button:

`Export Comparison PDF`

Show a loading/progress state during report generation.

